# LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file on
# the way in and out. That breaks byte-identical builds, makes content hashes
# platform-dependent — which matters here, because PRD 8.1 requires evaluation
# datasets to be content-hashed — and produces diffs where nothing changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated and checked in, so review should not drown in them.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
